### GET alle expenses van een trip
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1/expenses
Accept: application/json

### GET één expense detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/1
Accept: application/json

### POST nieuwe expense toevoegen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Hotelovernachting",
  "amount": 250.75,
  "category": "hotel",
  "expenseDate": "2025-08-06",
  "receiptUrl": "https://example.com/receipts/hotel.png",
  "validated": true
}

### PUT expense updaten
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Hotel + ontbijt",
  "amount": 300.50,
  "category": "hotel",
  "expenseDate": "2025-08-06",
  "receiptUrl": "https://example.com/receipts/hotel-breakfast.png",
  "validated": true
}

### DELETE expense
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/1
